  - unsaturated zone
  - blind validation
  - pre-registration
  - volcanic precursors
  - bradyseism
  - Campi Flegrei
abstract: >
  Complete model of Rn-222/Rn-220 transport in the unsaturated zone (dual
  continuum, Richards flow, pneumatic pressure, moisture-dependent emanation,
  activity-form decay chain, soil-building coupling), evaluated under a blind,
  pre-registered protocol on 15 volcanic and tectonic sites. This repository
  holds the model source; the preprint, the executable verification suite and
  the sealed prediction manifest are in the Zenodo deposit.
